      "name": "Complex Obstacle Course Navigation 1",
      "content": "Drone Cargo 9 navigates complex obstacle course from start (323, 340, 18) through waypoints (443, 365, 18), (523, 421, 18), (551, 498, 18), (403, 700, 18) to destination (662, 795, 18). Course includes obstacles Building 4, Telecom Mast 1, and Building 11. Must visit all waypoints in sequence while avoiding all obstacles, adjusting altitude as needed. Reach destination and land safely.",
