    {
      "id": "e5e3623a",
      "name": "Flight Marathon Navigation 1",
      "content": "Drone Cargo 8 performs a marathon flight. Take off to 24 meters, fly to start point (134, 196, 24), then navigate through 10 waypoints: (210, 176, 24), (396, 208, 24), (428, 342, 24), (523, 420, 24), (698, 572, 24), (784, 641, 24), (877, 752, 24), (987, 862, 24), (846, 189, 24), (117, 847, 24). Avoid obstacles Building 2, Water Tower. Finally, fly to end point (587, 512, 24) and land.",
